               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"imgGeo5\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgGeo5', '0%')\" src=\"\" class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 1</b>: This map highlights Africa in the world © Mapswire (<htcite0>)</p>",
