            {
               "text": "<center><div class=\"first_steps_reflection_parent\"><div class=\"first_steps_reflection question_mark\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\"></i></div><div class=\"first_steps_reflection\"><b>Reflection: On the Lack of Evidence</b><br /><br />\"The absence of evidence is not evidence of absence\" (<htcite0>) — researchers said this over a century ago.<br /><br />Dr. Igor Yanovich's remarks about scarce data deserve attention. But keeping in mind what “absence of evidence” means here: are his observations enough to reject the idea of two migration routes completely?</div></div></center></p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "95106e43-ec63-4b00-9852-ce703b0d8a78",
                     "text": "Wright, William",
                     "page": "pp. 59",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "1888",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "#### Genetics\n\nIgor Yanovich also points out that good genetic data from Sub-Saharan Africa has only been collected and studied in recent years (<htcite0>). Even so, genetic studies have generally supported the models proposed earlier (<htcite1>; <htcite2>; <htcite3>).\n\n#### Final reflection\n\nIn this text, we explored the Bantu expansion from a different angle than the genealogy section (<htcite4>).\n\nOne fact we met here — not covered in that genealogy section — is that more than 500 different languages come from the Bantu people (<htcite5>). With that in mind, here is our final question:",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "5f55c3fc-d434-4d56-a6fc-838649b8aa97",
                     "text": "Yanovich, I.",
