               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<center><div class=\"first_steps_reflection_parent\"><div class=\"first_steps_reflection question_mark\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\"></i></div><div class=\"first_steps_reflection\"><b>Reflection: Actions and Consequences</b><br /><br />If the Bantu people had never migrated, we might not have so many different languages that grew from them.<br /><br />If Europeans had not drawn the borders of Africa the way they did, the nations we know today might not exist.<br /><br />Many people alive now — and many who will live in the future — are the result of everything that happened in the past and that we studied in this text.<br /><br />What do you conclude from these events?<br />Have you ever stopped to think about questions like these?</div></div></center></p>",
